WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Getting started with DOS, in two minutes.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1 of 6: Sign in. Open DOS from your welcome email.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
New to DOS? Choose Email me a sign-in link and open it on the same device. Used DOS before? Sign in the way you usually do.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.700
Step 2 of 6: Home shows who needs you today: birthdays, meetings, and check-ins.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:45.000
Step 3 of 6: People. Everyone you're discipling, in one place.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:59.700
Open a person to see your last and next meeting, their Journey, and what you've committed to.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:17.300
Step 4 of 6: Meetings. See what's coming up and what still needs logging. Tap Log Meeting when you're done.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:29.400
Step 5 of 6: Prayer. Keep every request with the person it belongs to, and look back on what God has answered.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:37.000
Step 6 of 6: Add DOS to your phone. It's a web app, so there's nothing to download.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:46.400
iPhone, in Safari: tap Share, then Add to Home Screen, then Add. Android, in Chrome: tap the menu, then Install app or Add to Home screen.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:51.800
Meet. Minister. Multiply. Need help? Reply to your DOS welcome email.
